  "obligation": "Heap-owned Memory32 state and active data initialization, scalar little-endian loads/stores, unsigned addresses, bounds traps, size/grow, independent instance and alias/root lifecycle through the sole residual VM.",
  "representation": "Canonical module memory/data facts instantiate ArrayBuffer cells in existing Environment slots after globals. Pure Rust scalar rows derive decoded operator selection, width, signedness, value types and byte encoding. One range check owns access and active-data bounds. Five opcode families execute through existing dispatch/activation/root machinery; residual format is 47. Declared maxima feed backing bounds; pages derive from byte length. Unreferenced script roots are released; named aliases retain identity. Instantiation collects before creating unrooted bindings, never mid-construction.",
